    Bug 1921974 - Set nodefaultsrc to prevent secondary load of about:blank. r=mkmelin


    The reason for the observed missing error page is a race condition
    between the load of `about:blank` and the load of the error page. Due to
    changes in bug 1911977, the network activity in a browser with a failed
    protocol handler load is no longer stopped (to not trigger a network
    error page), which in this case does not stop the load of `about:blank`.

    The failed WebExtension protocol handler will trigger an error page
    nonetheless. The ongoing load of `about:blank` can race against it and
    if the error page is loaded faster than `about:blank`, we end up with a
    blank page instead of the error page.

    More details can be found in the bug.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229469

